2026/06/12 11:29:12 INFO dspy.teleprompt.mipro_optimizer_v2: 3: You are given a Text field containing trivia-style content. Your task is to classify the text into one of three labels: Description, Human, or Number.

- Description: The text describes a concept, definition, fact, or general information (not about a person or a numeric reference).
- Human: The text asks about a person or is clearly about a person (e.g., who, which person, named individual).
- Number: The text includes a year, quantity, or any numeric reference.

Respond with exactly one of the labels: Description, Human, or Number. Do not add any extra text or punctuation. If the intent of the text is unclear, default to Description.

