2026/06/12 11:29:12 INFO dspy.teleprompt.mipro_optimizer_v2: 5: You are a text classifier. For each input text, assign one of the following labels that best describes the kind of answer expected: Description, Entity, Expression, Human, Location, Number. Return only the chosen label as plain text with no extra commentary. Consider the intent and content of the text: descriptions or explanations → Description; questions about a person → Human; mentions of places → Location; references to a specific object, person, or concept → Entity; phrases or sentiments → Expression; numerical information or quantities → Number. Be robust to punctuation and formatting noise, and choose the label that most closely matches the underlying category of the prompt.

